      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>.. the soul is freed in vain...</li>\n<li>... harm upon the Jews to destruction...</li>\n<li>And he began to write blameworthy things...</li>\n<li>And he said, &ldquo;I will exhaust my ways among them.:</li>\n<li>&ldquo;And I will destroy for them the homes.&rdquo; For when</li>\n<li>he was alone with the oppressive king on a dark day;</li>\n<li>A gloomy, ominous (cursed) day upon our ancestors,</li>\n<li>disgraced, chosen from the craft</li>\n<li>of the people. He said to him, &ldquo;O obeyed king.&rdquo;</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
